## 4. ApplicationDbContext and Migrations

### `ApplicationDbContext` (`/Users/timohermans/Dev/WordPicker/src/WordPicker.Web/Data/ApplicationDbContext.cs`)

```csharp
public class ApplicationDbContext : DbContext
{
    public ApplicationDbContext(DbContextOptions<ApplicationDbContext> options) : base(options) { }

    public DbSet<WordList> WordLists => Set<WordList>();
    public DbSet<WordEntry> WordEntries => Set<WordEntry>();

    protected override void OnModelCreating(ModelBuilder modelBuilder)
    {
        // WordList config:
        //   - PK: Id
        //   - Name: required, max 200
        //   - CreatedAt: default CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
        //   - UpdatedAt: default CURRENT_TIMESTAMP

        // WordEntry config:
        //   - PK: Id
        //   - Value: required, max 100
        //   - CreatedAt: default CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
        //   - FK to WordList with cascade delete
        //   - Unique index on (WordListId, Value)
    }
}
```

### Existing Migration

**`20260728115238_InitialCreate`** (in `/Users/timohermans/Dev/WordPicker/src/WordPicker.Web/Migrations/`):

- Creates `WordLists` table: `Id` (int, PK, identity), `Name` (varchar(200), not null), `CreatedAt` (timestamptz, default CURRENT_TIMESTAMP), `UpdatedAt` (timestamptz, default CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
- Creates `WordEntries` table: `Id` (int, PK, identity), `WordListId` (int, FK -> WordLists, cascade delete), `Value` (varchar(100), not null), `CreatedAt` (timestamptz, default CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
- Creates unique index `IX_WordEntries_WordListId_Value` on `(WordListId, Value)`

Migration is already applied (the project has been built; no pending migrations).

